{"strongs": "H3617", "word": "כָּלָה", "translit": "ka.lah", "root": "כלב", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "completion, complete destruction, consumption, annihilation", "definition": "כָּלָה noun feminine completion, complete destruction, consumption, annihilation ; always this form; — 1. completion , but only as adverb, and dubious: completely, altogether Gen 18:21 ( J ; read כֻּלָּם Ol Kau Buhl ), Exod 11:1 (si vera lectio) 2. complete destruction, consumption, annihilation: \\ \\ a. almost always by God, especially ׳ עָשָׂה כ Isa 10:23 (+ וְנֶחֱרָצָה ), Nah 1:8 (2 accusative, si vera lectio; Buhl ZAW 1885, 181 proposes בְּקָמָיו for מְקוֺמָהּ see Id HWB 12 Kau AT, Text Krit. Erläut. p. 65 ; see also מָקוֺם below קום ), v Nah 1:9 ; Jer 4:27 ; Neh 9:31 (2 accusative); + אֵת person = with , pregnant sense, = in dealing with (compare II. אֵת 1 d ), Zeph 1:18 ( אַךְ נִבְהָלָה ׳ כ ), Jer 5:18 ; Jer 30:11 = Jer 46:28 ( אֹתְָךָ = אִתְּךָ ), Ezek 11:13 ; Ezek 20:17 ( אוֺתָם = אִתָּם ); + בְּכָלגּֿוֺיִם Jer 30:11 ; Jer 46:28 without וְנֶחֱרָצָה שָׁמַעְתִּי ׃עשׂה ׳ כ Isa 28:22 , ׳ וְנ ׳ עַדכֿ Dan 9:27 (on both compare Isa 10:23 ; Zeph 1:18 ); לְכָלָה for annihilation Ezek 13:13 (si vera lectio, see Co ), ׳ וְלֹא לְהַשְׁחִית לְכ 2Chr 12:12 . \\ \\ b. by men, אַלֿ ׳ וְכ תַּעֲשׂוּ Jer 5:10 בְיָדוֺ ׳ וְכ Dan 11:16 and (i.e. with ) annihilation in his hand.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4020')\">BDB4020</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3617')\">H3617</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4019')\">BDB4019</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4021')\">BDB4021</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>כָּלָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>completion, complete destruction, consumption, annihilation</highlightword>; always this form; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>completion</highlight>, but only as adverb, and dubious: <highlight>completely, altogether</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 18:21\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,21)\">Gen 18:21</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>; read <bdbheb>כֻּלָּם</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ol')\">Ol</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kau')\">Kau</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl</lookup>), <ref ref=\"Exod 11:1\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(2,11,1)\">Exod 11:1</ref> (si vera lectio) </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>complete destruction, consumption, annihilation:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> almost always by God, especially <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עָשָׂה כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 10:23\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,23)\">Isa 10:23</ref> (+ <bdbheb>וְנֶחֱרָצָה</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Nah 1:8\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(34,1,8)\">Nah 1:8</ref> (2 accusative, si vera lectio; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl<sup>ZAW 1885, 181</sup></lookup> proposes <bdbheb>בְּקָמָיו</bdbheb> for <bdbheb>מְקוֺמָהּ</bdbheb> see Id<sup>HWB 12</sup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kau')\">Kau<sup>AT, Text Krit. Erläut. p. 65</sup></lookup>; see also  <bdbheb><reflink>מָקוֺם</reflink></bdbheb> below <bdbheb>קום</bdbheb>), v<ref ref=\"Nah 1:9\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(34,1,9)\">Nah 1:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 4:27\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(24,4,27)\">Jer 4:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 9:31\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(16,9,31)\">Neh 9:31</ref> (2 accusative); + <bdbheb>אֵת</bdbheb> person = <highlight>with</highlight>, pregnant sense, = <highlight>in dealing with</highlight> (compare II. <bdbheb>אֵת</bdbheb> <b>1 d</b>), <ref ref=\"Zeph 1:18\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(36,1,18)\">Zeph 1:18</ref> (<bdbheb>אַךְ נִבְהָלָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Jer 5:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,5,18)\">Jer 5:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 30:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,30,11)\">Jer 30:11</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 46:28\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,28)\">Jer 46:28</ref> (<bdbheb>אֹתְָךָ</bdbheb> = <bdbheb>אִתְּךָ</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ezek 11:13\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(26,11,13)\">Ezek 11:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 20:17\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(26,20,17)\">Ezek 20:17</ref> (<bdbheb>אוֺתָם</bdbheb> = <bdbheb>אִתָּם</bdbheb>); + <bdbheb>בְּכָלגּֿוֺיִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 30:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,30,11)\">Jer 30:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 46:28\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,28)\">Jer 46:28</ref> without <bdbheb>וְנֶחֱרָצָה שָׁמַעְתִּי ׃עשׂה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 28:22\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,22)\">Isa 28:22</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְנ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עַדכֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 9:27\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(27,9,27)\">Dan 9:27</ref> (on both compare <ref ref=\"Isa 10:23\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,23)\">Isa 10:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zeph 1:18\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(36,1,18)\">Zeph 1:18</ref>); <bdbheb>לְכָלָה</bdbheb> <highlight>for annihilation</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ezek 13:13\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(26,13,13)\">Ezek 13:13</ref> (si vera lectio, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup>), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְלֹא לְהַשְׁחִית לְכ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 12:12\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(14,12,12)\">2Chr 12:12</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> by men, <bdbheb>אַלֿ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְכ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>תַּעֲשׂוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 5:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,5,10)\">Jer 5:10</ref> <bdbheb>בְיָדוֺ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְכ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 11:16\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(27,11,16)\">Dan 11:16</ref> <highlight>and</highlight> (i.e. <highlight>with</highlight>) <highlight>annihilation in his hand.</highlight> </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 18:21", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 18, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Exod 11:1", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 11, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Isa 10:23", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 10, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Nah 1:8", "book": "NAM", "chapter": 1, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Nah 1:9", "book": "NAM", "chapter": 1, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Jer 4:27", "book": "JER", "chapter": 4, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "Neh 9:31", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 9, "verse": 31}, {"raw": "Zeph 1:18", "book": "ZEP", "chapter": 1, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Jer 5:18", "book": "JER", "chapter": 5, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Jer 30:11", "book": "JER", "chapter": 30, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Jer 46:28", "book": "JER", "chapter": 46, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Ezek 11:13", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 11, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Ezek 20:17", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 20, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Isa 28:22", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 28, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Dan 9:27", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 9, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "Ezek 13:13", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 13, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "2Chr 12:12", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 12, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Jer 5:10", "book": "JER", "chapter": 5, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Dan 11:16", "book": "DA